  "articleBody": "It's super frustrating when your home feels chilly even with the heat on, right? Drafty windows are a common culprit, and often, it's a clear sign that your windows are past their prime. You might notice cold air seeping in, rattling sashes, or even condensation between the panes. These issues don't just make your home uncomfortable; they're also sending your energy bills through the roof. If you're constantly adjusting the thermostat or feeling a chill near your windows, it's a good indicator that something's up. Our team at Affordable Home Remodeling sees this a lot in older homes around Southern California. We help homeowners figure out if it's just a simple seal problem or if it’s time for a full replacement to bring back that cozy feeling. Don't let drafty windows steal your comfort and cash! Get in touch for a no-obligation chat about your options.",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-04"
